Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:20.90,zh,,0,0,0,,騙人的吧\N{\rja}ウソ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.90,0:00:22.62,zh,,0,0,0,,啊 綾音 早啊\N{\rja}あっ アヤネちゃん おはよう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:23.55,zh,,0,0,0,,為什麼\N{\rja}なんで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:25.27,zh,,0,0,0,,為什麼\N{\rja}どうして
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:25.88,screen,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\frz20\bord0\fnHarmonyOS Sans SC\fs45\c&HD4B8A0&\move(825.6,257.6,823.6,141.6)}退學申請書
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:25.88,screen,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\bord0\frz20\fs25\c&HD4B8A0&\move(668,396,668,284,0,2320)}希望從阿拜多斯高等學校退學。
